# Spiking Neural Network using LIF Neuron

A neuromorphic computing project that simulates a Leaky Integrate-and-Fire neuron
and analyzes firing rate behavior under different input currents.

🧠 Domain: Neuromorphic Computing / Computational Neuroscience
## Technologies Used
- Python
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Neuromorphic Modeling

## Problem Statement
Traditional neural models are computationally expensive.
This project explores biologically inspired LIF neurons
to efficiently model spiking behavior.

